ttata e ancora più sinistra."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"After a mysterious force decimates the world’s population, Sebastian must navigate his own survival journey through the desolate streets of Barcelona. As he forms uneasy alliances with other survivors and they try to escape the city, an unexpected and even more sinister threat grows.","tagline":"Fear the ones who see."},{"language":"es-ES","overview":"Tras la llegada de una misteriosa presencia que está destruyendo la población mundial, Sebastián comienza un viaje de supervivencia a través de las desiertas calles de Barcelona. Por el camino se encontrará con otros supervivientes con los que formará alianzas inciertas para intentar escapar de la ciudad. Pronto se darán cuenta de que hay una nueva e inesperada amenaza aún más peligrosa."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2U7bGDPwz4oKVbICjrWIjHxv5GG.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7tu0bQi8Tw2BrOB5vFyUjVtWma0.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":805320,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"es-ES","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2U7bGDPwz4oKVbICjrWIjHxv5GG.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2U7bGDPwz4oKVbICjrWIjHxv5GG.jpg","language":"it","width":1500,"height":2250},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2U7bGDPwz4oKVbICjrWIjHxv5GG.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2U7bGDPwz4oKVbICjrWIjHxv5GG.jpg","language":"it","width":1500,"height":2250}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iTGBHdL12QEpLyRVlykDuiYxzAG.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iTGBHdL12QEpLyRVlykDuiYxzAG.jpg","language":"en","width":1482,"height":2222},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iT